I left out the `aap:caps/http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the body can't extend that grant. The fetch would also send feed text to an external host, which is outside the node's declared authority. Once the graph definition and grant are updated, I can add it.

